        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Armour / Regeneration &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Lacquer Shell</p><p><em>A hard, bright, corrosion-proof lacquer over everything. It buffs out.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Carapace <strong>Hardness +2</strong>. <strong>Resistance 2</strong> to acid.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Hardness +5</strong>, <strong>resistance 5</strong> to acid. Your Carapace repairs 1 Hit Point per hour on its own.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Hardness +8</strong>, <strong>resistance 8</strong> to acid. You are immune to rust, corrosion and effects that damage your items with acid.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Hardness +12</strong>, <strong>resistance 12</strong> to acid. Once per encounter, when your Carapace's Hardness would be reduced or bypassed, it isn't.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
